# Whiteflow local workspace (owner, 2026-11-06): kept on disk next to the checkout, never in git.
# Planning docs (Business Payments PRD, Whiteflow vision and build plan) and any other loose
# root-level .md file are local; the project's own root docs listed below stay tracked.
/*.md
!/AI_USAGE.md
!/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/PHASES.md
!/README.md
!/WHITECHAIN_FEEDBACK.md
# Pixa wallet source (MIT): a local reference copy. The parts adapted into packages/mcp are credited in README and packages/mcp/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES
/Pixa-main/
# Pre-git snapshot of this repo that the Whiteflow sessions still work in
/merchant-capital-plus-main/

# Agent working files: briefs, batch reviews, phase notes, agent config (owner, 2026-11-07: keep them out of the
# public repo), and the per-lane agent prompts. They stay on disk in each checkout; AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and PIPELINE.md
# are covered by /*.md above. tools/ stays tracked: ~/.local/bin/agentbus and the hooks run from a checkout's tools/.
.batches/
.claude/
docs/prompts/
notes/
opencode.json
